timestamp=2026-11-14T21:10:46.211Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Let us check unit economics of H vs N vs Cloud vs Spot vs Options\n# Gen H: $25M per 1k (1 kH). Needs 1.4 MW.\n# At month m, used value = 25 * 0.96^m * (0.5 if m >= launch else 1.0).\n# At settlement (month 24), marked at 75% of used-market value at month 24!\n# Wait: 0.96^24 = 0.3754. With gen N launch (guaranteed between 9 and 15), gen H value at month 24 is:\n# 25 * 0.3754 * 0.5 = 4.6925M. Marked at 75% = 3.519M!\n# So buying 1k gen H at month 0 ($25M) has net depreciation by month 24 of 25 - 3.52 = $21.48M!\n# Plus power: 1.4 MW * power_price * months + interest/cost of capital (0.75%/mo on cash or 2%/mo on debt).\n# Power prices: us 0.15 -> 0.21/mo per kH; eu 0.20 -> 0.28/mo per kH; ap 0.12 -> 0.168/mo per kH.\n# Over 21 usable months (m=3..23): depreciation $21.48M / 21 = $1.023M/mo + $0.21M power + ~0.12M/mo opportunity cost = ~$1.35M/kH-mo!\n# Wait: what if gen N launches at month 12?\n# Gen N costs $40M per 1k, gives 2 kH (so $20M per kH!), needs 1.6 MW (0.8 MW per kH!).\n# Gen N at month 24 (say 12 months after launch): used value = 40 * 0.96^12 = 24.51M. Marked at 75% = 18.38M per 1k ($9.19M per kH)!\n# So buying 1k gen N at month 12 ($40M = $20M/kH) and using for 9 months (m=15..23):\n# Depreciation = (40 - 18.38)/2 = $10.81M per kH over 9 months = $1.20M/kH-mo + power (0.8*0.15 = $0.12M/mo) + capital (~0.15M) = ~$1.47M/kH-mo!\n# Wait: what about 24-month power contract? If you sign power at month 12, energised at month 15, it runs 15..38 (15 months past month 23!).\n# You pay 15 months of unused power at settlement!\n# 15 * 0.15 * 0.8 = $1.8M per kH extra! (And for 0.8 MW/kH in us: 15 * 0.15 * 0.8 = $1.8M / 9 = $0.20M/kH-mo).\n# What about cloud reservations?\n# Contract index starts at $1.6M!\n# Right now (month 0): 12m is $1.60M, 24m is $1.44M, 6m is $1.84M (x site multiple: ap 0.95, us 1.0, eu 1.1).\n# AND: \"At launch, used gen H value drops 50% and cloud contract prices drop 25%.\"\n# Wait: if contract index drops 25% at launch (m=9..15), a 24-month contract signed NOW in month 0 runs months 1..24 (only 1 month past 23!),\n# at $1.44M * 0.95 = $1.368M/mo in ap (paid up front though, or monthly? \"You pay the whole term, including any months after month 23\" - wait: paid at signing or monthly? Let us check!)\nprint(\"0.96^24 =\", 0.96**24)\nprint(\"Gen H 24m resale mark:\", 25 * 0.96**24 * 0.5 * 0.75)\nprint(\"Gen N 12m resale mark per kH:\", 40 * 0.96**12 * 0.75 / 2)\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
