timestamp=2026-11-14T21:11:35.382Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Run 1 (months 0..7): training needed = 60 kH-months.\n# Suppose we ONLY have starting 10k H + 1.14k powered from queue + 2k us res (m0..4) + 1k ap res (m1..7)\n# Wait: what if we get power in ap or us in month 3..5 so the remaining 2.86k H from vendor queue gets powered?\n# Let us simulate Run 1 under 4% and 8% growth:\nfor g in [0.04, 0.08]:\n    inf_sum = sum(6.0 * (1+g)**m for m in range(8))\n    # Existing powered cap without new power:\n    # m0: 12.0; m1..4: 13.14; m5..7: 11.14\n    base_cap = 12.0 + 4*13.14 + 3*11.14\n    print(f\"g={g}: inf_sum={inf_sum:.1f}, needed_total={inf_sum+60:.1f}, base_cap_no_new_power={base_cap:.1f}, shortfall={inf_sum+60 - base_cap:.1f}\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
