timestamp=2026-11-14T21:11:48.851Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Let us check capacity trajectory if we buy NO more Gen H vs buying say 4k-8k Gen H now.\n# Currently we have:\n# - 6k H in us (m0..19 power)\n# - 4k H in eu (m0..19 power)\n# - 4k H in queue to us (arrives m1..2 -> total 14k H!)\n# Suppose we get power for all 14k H (need 4 MW more in us or ap, plus at m20 we need power for all).\n# 14k H gives 14 kH/mo!\n# Look at Run 2 (months 8..15):\n# Avg demand (inf + training 140) is 27.0 kH/mo (4%) to 32.3 kH/mo (8%)!\n# Wait: 14k H is ONLY 14 kH/mo!!\n# Where do the other 13 to 18 kH/mo in months 8..15 come from?!\n# Gen N launches in month 9..15 (avg 12) -> takes 3 months from order at vendor (arrives m12..18, avg m15)!\n# So Gen N CANNOT contribute much to Run 2 (months 8..15)!!\n# Let us verify that!\n# If Gen N launches at m=12, earliest vendor Gen N order is m=12 -> usable m=15 (only 1 month of Run 2!).\n# Even if Gen N launches at m=9, earliest usable is m=12 (only 4 months of Run 2).\n# Even from a broker (if reliable!), earliest usable is m=11..14!\n# Therefore, ALL of Run 2 (avg 27-32 kH/mo across m8..15, ~215-258 kH-months total) MUST come from:\n#   1. Our starting 10k H + 4k queued H (= 14 kH/mo)\n#   2. More Gen H GPUs bought in months 0..5 (vendor or broker)\n#   3. Cloud reservations & options & spot!\nprint(\"Run 2 total needed: 216 to 258 kH-mo -> 27 to 32 kH/mo!\")\nprint(\"With 14k H owned, gap in Run 2 is 13 to 18 kH/mo = 104 to 144 kH-months!\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
