timestamp=2026-11-14T21:12:12.545Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Simulate Run 1 (m0..7) and Run 2 (m8..15) with:\n# - existing 10k H + 4k queued H (arriving m1..2, powered by m4..5)\n# - ap reservation 3k 12m (m1..12)\n# - buying X kH Gen H at m0 (arriving m3..4 in ap, powered by m4..5)\nfor X in [0, 4, 6, 8]:\n    for g in [0.04, 0.08]:\n        cap = [0]*16\n        for m in range(16):\n            c = 10.0\n            if m <= 4: c += 2.0 # initial us res\n            if m >= 1: c += 1.14 # spare us power for queued H\n            if m >= 4: c += 2.86 # rest of queued H once new power energised\n            if 1 <= m <= 12: c += 3.0 # new ap 12m res\n            if m >= 4: c += X # new Gen H\n            cap[m] = c\n        inf = [6.0 * (1+g)**m for m in range(16)]\n        r1_spare = sum(cap[m] - inf[m] for m in range(8))\n        r2_spare = sum(cap[m] - inf[m] for m in range(8, 16))\n        print(f\"Buy X={X}k H, g={g:.2f}: Run1 spare={r1_spare:.1f}/60, Run2 spare={r2_spare:.1f}/140\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
