timestamp=2026-11-14T21:13:34.009Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\nimport math\n# Inference demand: m0=6.64, m1=6.27, m2=7.13\n# Suppose baseline d0 ~ 6.0 (or 6.0 * (1+noise)), and d_m = 6.0 * (1+g)^m * eps_m, eps ~ N(1, 0.05)\n# Wait: does m0 already have 1 step of growth or start near 6? \"Total demand starts near 6 kH and grows...\"\n# Let us check likelihood for g=0.04 vs g=0.08 with d0 in [5.7, 6.3] or d0=6.0:\nobs = [6.64, 6.27, 7.13]\nfor g in [0.04, 0.08]:\n    pred = [6.0 * (1+g)**m for m in range(3)]\n    rel_err = [(o - p)/p for o, p in zip(obs, pred)]\n    ll = sum(-0.5 * (e/0.05)**2 for e in rel_err)\n    print(f\"g={g}: pred={[round(x,2) for x in pred]}, rel_err={[round(e,3) for e in rel_err]}, ll={ll:.2f}\")\n\n# Check Run 2 (m8..15) with current fleet:\n# Owned H after #2 arrives: 7.14(us) + 4(eu) + 6.86(ap) = 18.0k (plus 6 MW us energises at m8!)\n# Wait: if we do NOT buy any more Gen H, and only reserve 1k/mo in ap+us when tight (or more if loose):\n# Current reservations:\n# m8..12: ap 3, us 3 = 6 kH -> total 24 kH!\n# m13: ap 2, us 2 = 4 kH -> total 22 kH!\n# m14: ap 1, us 1 = 2 kH -> total 20 kH!\n# m15: 0 -> total 18 kH!\n# Remember Run 2 (m8..15) needs:\n#   4% growth: inf=75.7 + 140 = 215.7 (27.0/mo)\n#   8% growth: inf=118.1 + 140 = 258.1 (32.3/mo)\n# With 18k H + existing res, m8..15 total without new orders = 18*8 + 6*5 + 4 + 2 = 180 kH-mo!!\n# Shortfall in Run 2 WITHOUT new orders = 36 to 78 kH-months!!\nprint(\"Run 2 current committed cap (m8..15) = 180 kH-mo vs needed 216..258 -> gap 36..78 kH-mo!\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
