timestamp=2026-11-14T21:13:53.199Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Inference growth posterior:\nobs = [6.64, 6.27, 7.13, 7.55]\nfor g in [0.04, 0.08]:\n    pred = [6.0 * (1+g)**m for m in range(4)]\n    rel_err = [(o - p)/p for o, p in zip(obs, pred)]\n    ll = sum(-0.5 * (e/0.05)**2 for e in rel_err)\n    print(f\"g={g}: pred={[round(x,2) for x in pred]}, ll={ll:.2f}\")\n\n# Check Run 2 (m8..15) if g=0.08 (inf_sum = 118.1 + 140 = 258.1 kH-mo!):\n# Owned H by m7:\n# - us: 7.14k (plus 6 MW us arrives m8 -> can power up to 11.4k H or 7.14k H + 7.5 kH N!)\n# - eu: 4.00k\n# - ap: 6.02 + 0.84 (#2) + 3.00 (#4) = 9.86k (uses 13.8 MW of 14 MW!)\n# Total owned H by m7 = 7.14 + 4.00 + 9.86 = 21.00k!\n# Reservations currently active in m8..15:\n# - m1..12: 2k (ap 1, us 1) -> active m8..12 (5 mos) = 10\n# - m2..13: 2k (ap 1, us 1) -> active m8..13 (6 mos) = 12\n# - m3..14: 2k (ap 1, us 1) -> active m8..14 (7 mos) = 14\n# - m4..15: 3k (ap 1, us 1, eu 1) -> active m8..15 (8 mos) = 24\n# Total Run 2 capacity WITHOUT any new contracts/GPUs = 21*8 + 10 + 12 + 14 + 24 = 168 + 60 = 228 kH-mo!\n# Needed in Run 2 at 8% growth = 258.1 kH-mo!\n# Shortfall if 8% growth = 258.1 - 228 = 30.1 kH-mo!!\n# Wait: what if we add reserve 1 12 ap + reserve 1 12 us in m4 (m5..16) -> +16 kH-mo in Run 2 (= 244)!\n# Plus in m5, m6, m7 we can reserve more OR exercise options OR Gen N arrives at m14-15 (if launch m11)!\nprint(\"Run 2 capacity with current owned+res = 228 kH-mo vs 258.1 needed (at 8%) -> gap 30.1 kH-mo!\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
