timestamp=2026-11-14T21:14:16.849Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Run 2 (m8..15) check at 8% growth (and what if it switches to 4% at m10?)\n# Current capacity committed for m8..15:\n# Owned H:\n#   us: 7.14k (plus 6 MW arrives m8)\n#   eu: 4.00k\n#   ap: 6.86k + 3.00k (#4 arrives m6..7) = 9.86k\n# Total owned H = 21.00k!\n# Reservations active in m8..15:\n#   m1..12: 2k (5 mos) = 10\n#   m2..13: 2k (6 mos) = 12\n#   m3..14: 2k (7 mos) = 14\n#   m4..15: 3k (8 mos) = 24\n#   m5..16: 2k (8 mos) = 16\n# Total committed = 21*8 + 10+12+14+24+16 = 168 + 76 = 244 kH-mo!\n# Needed at 8% constant: inf=118.1 + 140 = 258.1 kH-mo -> gap ONLY 14.1 kH-mo!\n# (And if Broker B delivers 1k at m6 -> +8 kH-mo -> gap ONLY 6.1 kH-mo!)\n# Wait: what about site inference in m8..15 at 8% growth?!\nfor m in range(8, 16):\n    tot = 6.0 * (1.08**m)\n    print(f\"m{m}: tot={tot:.1f} | us={0.5*tot:.1f} (have ~10-11), eu={0.3*tot:.1f} (have 5.0), ap={0.2*tot:.1f} (have ~12)\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
