timestamp=2026-11-14T21:14:40.708Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Plan Run 2 (m8..15) and Run 3 (m16..23)\n# Suppose Gen N launches at month L in {9, 10, 11, 12, 13}.\n# Vendor Gen N allocation: 4k/mo loose (= 8 kH/mo), 1.5k/mo tight (= 3 kH/mo).\n# Wait: if supply is TIGHT when Gen N launches (1.5k/mo = 3 kH/mo!), how much Gen N can we even get from vendor for Run 3 (m16..23)?!\n# Check!!\n# If L=11, orders placed at m11 ship at:\n#   m11..13 (usable m14..16): 1.5k/mo * 3 = 4.5k (9 kH)\n#   m14..16 (usable m17..19): 4.5k (9 kH)\n#   m17..19 (usable m20..22): 4.5k (9 kH)\n#   m20 (usable m23): 1.5k (3 kH)\n# Average Gen N capacity in m16..23 if TIGHT and L=11:\n#   m16: 9 kH, m17: 12, m18: 15, m19: 18, m20: 21, m21: 24, m22: 27, m23: 30 -> avg = 19.5 kH/mo!!\n# Wait: if L=13 and TIGHT:\n#   m16: 3 kH, m17: 6, m18: 9, m19: 12, m20: 15, m21: 18, m22: 21, m23: 24 -> avg = 13.5 kH/mo!!\n# AND look at our existing 21k H GPUs in m16..23:\n#   In m16..19: 21 kH!\n#   In m20..23: us 10 MW (7.14k H) and eu 6 MW (4.00k H) EXPIRE!!\n#   Wait: us still has 6 MW (m8..31) and ap has 14 MW (m2/4..25/27)!\n#   So in m20..23, if we only have 20 MW (6 us + 14 ap), we can ONLY power 14k H (or 25 kH N)!!\n#   Total capacity in m16..23 WITHOUT more power + cloud/options would be:\n#     ~19.5 (N) + ~15 (H powered) = 34.5 kH/mo vs 53..67 kH/mo NEEDED!!\n# WHOA!! Look how huge that gap is in Run 3 if tight!!\nfor L in [9, 11, 13]:\n    for alloc in [1.5, 4.0]: # tight vs loose\n        n_by_m = []\n        for m in range(16, 24):\n            ship_months = max(0, m - (L + 2)) # ordered at L, arrives L+3..\n            n_by_m.append(ship_months * alloc * 2) # 2 kH per 1k N\n        print(f\"L={L}, alloc={alloc}: N kH in m16..23 = {n_by_m}, avg={sum(n_by_m)/8:.1f}, max_N_MW={n_by_m[-1]*0.8:.1f}\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
