timestamp=2026-11-14T21:17:27.554Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Run 3 (m16..23) detailed capacity & site inference plan!\n# Let us project inference from m14=19.93 (with est baseline ~ 6.35 * 1.08^m):\nd0 = 6.35\nfor g_late, label in [(0.08, \"8% continues\"), (0.04, \"switches to 4% at m15\")]:\n    inf = []\n    d = d0 * (1.08**14) # m14 = 18.65 (smoothed) or use 19.2\n    for m in range(15, 24):\n        d = d * (1.08 if m==15 and g_late==0.08 else (1+g_late))\n        if m >= 16: inf.append(d)\n    print(f\"=== {label}: Run3 inf={sum(inf):.1f} + 320 = {sum(inf)+320:.1f} kH-mo ===\")\n    for idx, m in enumerate(range(16, 24)):\n        t = inf[idx]\n        print(f\"  m{m}: tot={t:.1f} | us={0.5*t:.1f}, eu={0.3*t:.1f}, ap={0.2*t:.1f}\")\n\n# Current owned H powered in m16..23:\n# m16..19: us=7.14, eu=4.00, ap=9.86 -> 21.00 kH/mo\n# m20..23: us 10MW expires (leaving us=16 MW!) and eu 6MW expires (leaving eu=0 MW!)\n# Wait: in m20..23, ap has 32 MW (9.86k H = 13.8 MW -> 18.2 MW free = 22.75 kH N)\n# us has 16 MW (can power 7.14k H [10 MW] + 3.75k N [6 MW] = 14.64 kH, OR if we move 2.14k H to us? No, 10 MW powers H at 1 kH/1.4 MW vs N at 1 kH/0.8 MW; we only have 6k N ordered so far = 9.6 MW!)\n# So ALL 6k N (= 12 kH, 9.6 MW) fits into ap 18.2 MW spare! And us keeps 7.14k H in m20..23 (uses 10 MW of us 16 MW)!\n# Only eu 4.00k H loses power at m20 (if we want, we could move 4k H from eu -> ap/us! Wait: ap has 8.6 MW spare even after 6k N -> powers 6.14k H!!)!\n# WHOA!! Check that:\n# ap has 32 MW total! 9.86k H uses 13.8 MW. 6k N uses 9.6 MW. 13.8 + 9.6 = 23.4 MW -> 8.6 MW SPARE IN AP at m20..23!!\n# 8.6 MW in ap powers 8.6 / 1.4 = 6.14k H!!\n# AND us has 6 MW SPARE at m20..23 (powers 4.28k H)!!\n# So at m19, we can MOVE all 4.00k H from eu to ap (costs ONLY $2.0M!!), keeping ALL 21k H powered through m23!!\nprint(\"\\nBase owned H (if move 4k H eu->ap at m19 = $2M): 21.0 kH/mo for ALL m16..23 = 168 kH-mo!\")\nprint(\"Existing res in m16..18: m16=3 (ap 1, us 2), m17=1 (us 1), m18=1 (us 1) -> +5 kH-mo!\")\nprint(\"Gen N (6k ordered m13 -> 12 kH):\")\nprint(\"  If tight (1.5k/mo = 3 kH/mo): [3, 6, 9, 12, 12, 12, 12, 12] = 78 kH-mo -> total w/o new opt = 168+5+78 = 251 kH-mo\")\nprint(\"  If loose (4k/mo = 8 kH/mo): [8, 12, 12, 12, 12, 12, 12, 12] = 92 kH-mo -> total w/o new opt = 168+5+92 = 265 kH-mo\")\nprint(\"Needed in Run 3: 527 to 565 kH-mo -> Options/Cloud needed = 260 to 314 kH-mo (~43 to 52 six-month options!!)\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
