timestamp=2026-11-14T21:17:50.719Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\n# Run 3 (m16..23) exact inventory right now:\n# Owned H (assuming we move 4k H from eu -> ap at m19, cost $2M, keeping all 21k H powered!):\n#   Wait: check power in ap+us at m20..23:\n#   ap: 32 MW. 9.86k H = 13.804 MW. 6.00k N = 9.60 MW. Total = 23.404 MW -> 8.596 MW free!\n#   4.00k H from eu needs 5.60 MW <= 8.596 MW!! Fits with 3.00 MW to spare!\n#   us: 16 MW at m20..23. 7.14k H = 10.00 MW -> 6.00 MW free!\n# So ALL 21k H + 6k N (12 kH) stays 100% powered in m20..23 if we move 4k H eu->ap at m19!\n#\n# Owned capacity m16..23:\n#   H: 21.0 kH * 8 mos = 168.0 kH-mo\n#   N: 10.02 kH in m16, 12.00 kH in m17..23 -> 10.02 + 7*12 = 94.02 kH-mo\n# Existing reservations m16..21:\n#   m16: ap 1 + us 2 = 3\n#   m17..18: us 1 = 1/mo -> 2\n#   m16..21 options (20 kH: 4 eu, 6 us, 10 ap): 20 * 6 = 120\n# Total Run 3 capacity ALREADY COMMITTED = 168 + 94.02 + 3 + 2 + 120 = 387.02 kH-mo!!\n#\n# Now check Run 3 total needed under BOTH 4% (switched at m14/15) and 8% (continues):\nfor g, label in [(0.04, \"switched to 4% at m14/15\"), (0.08, \"8% continues\")]:\n    d = 18.8 # approx m15 smoothed\n    inf = []\n    for m in range(16, 24):\n        d *= (1 + g)\n        inf.append(d)\n    tot = sum(inf) + 320\n    gap = tot - 387.02\n    print(f\"{label}: inf={sum(inf):.1f} + 320 = {tot:.1f} -> gap = {gap:.1f} kH-mo ({gap/6:.1f} six-month options needed at m17!)\")\n    for idx, m in enumerate(range(16, 24)):\n        t = inf[idx]\n        print(f\"  m{m}: tot={t:.1f} | us={0.5*t:.1f}, eu={0.3*t:.1f}, ap={0.2*t:.1f}\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
