timestamp=2026-11-14T21:18:28.182Z level=INFO run=7c5722be message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\nimport math\nobs = [6.64, 6.27, 7.13, 7.55, 8.43, 8.32, 9.31, 11.73, 10.83, 12.67, 12.63, 14.76, 15.60, 17.35, 19.93, 18.18, 20.84]\n# Compare likelihood of 8% constant vs switch to 4% at m_sw in 8..15:\n# Model d_m = d0 * prod_{t=0..m-1}(1+g_t) * eps, eps ~ N(1, 0.05)\ndef best_ll(gs):\n    # grid or closed form d0\n    prod = [1.0]\n    for g in gs: prod.append(prod[-1]*(1+g))\n    # MLE d0:\n    d0 = sum(o/p for o, p in zip(obs, prod)) / len(obs)\n    ll = sum(-0.5 * ((o - d0*p)/(0.05*d0*p))**2 for o, p in zip(obs, prod))\n    return ll, d0\n\nll_8, d0_8 = best_ll([0.08]*16)\nprint(f\"8% constant: d0={d0_8:.3f}, ll={ll_8:.2f}, pred_m16={d0_8*1.08**16:.2f}\")\nfor m_sw in range(8, 16):\n    gs = [0.08 if m < m_sw else 0.04 for m in range(16)]\n    ll, d0 = best_ll(gs)\n    print(f\"Switch to 4% at m={m_sw}: d0={d0:.3f}, ll={ll:.2f}, pred_m16={d0*math.prod(1+g for g in gs):.2f}\")\n\n# Now compute remaining Run 3 training needed after m16:\n# Done = 34.19, needed = 320 -> remaining for m17..23 = 285.81 kH-mo!\n# Committed capacity in m17..23 BEFORE new m17 options (assuming we move 4k H eu->ap at m19!):\n# m17: us=7.14+7, eu=4.0+4, ap=9.86+12+10 -> total = 54.00\n# m18: us=7.14+7, eu=4.0+4, ap=9.86+12+10 -> total = 54.00\n# m19: us=7.14+6, eu=4.0+4, ap=9.86+12+10 -> total = 53.00 (remember 4k H in eu moves at END of m19 or during m19?\n# WAIT!! RULE CHECK: \"move_gpus: they are out of service for the rest of this month and arrive for next month.\"\n# THAT MEANS if we move 4k H from eu->ap in m19, they are OUT OF SERVICE for m19!!\n# Whereas if we move them at m19, we lose 4.00 kH in m19 (paying $2M + losing 4 kH-mo)!\n# Compare: if we DON'T move them, we lose 4.00 kH * 4 mos (m20..23) = 16 kH-mo!\n# If we DO move them in m19, we lose 4 kH in m19, gain 4*4=16 kH in m20..23 -> net +12 kH-mo for $2M = $0.167M/kH-mo!!" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
